@startuml
title Cas d'utilisation Kolos — amendement complétion (T08 / Option C)

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #333333
}

actor "Visiteur" as V
actor "Utilisateur inscrit" as U
actor "Demandeur" as D
actor "Aidant" as A
actor "Administrateur" as ADM

U <|-- D
U <|-- A

rectangle "Kolos — MVP livré / complétion" {
  usecase "Consulter landing\n(SEO)" as UC_Home
  usecase "Créer un compte" as UC_Register
  usecase "Se connecter" as UC_Login
  usecase "Compléter profil\naidant" as UC_Profile
  usecase "Tableau de bord" as UC_Dashboard

  usecase "Publier une demande" as UC_Publish
  usecase "Consulter les demandes" as UC_Browse
  usecase "Candidater" as UC_Apply
  usecase "Consulter candidatures\nreçues" as UC_ViewApplications
  usecase "Sélectionner un aidant" as UC_Select

  usecase "Simuler paiement\n(mock)" as UC_MockPay
  usecase "Échanger par\nmessagerie (Mongo)" as UC_Message
  usecase "Signaler un incident\n(PG)" as UC_Report

  usecase "Lister les\nsignalements" as UC_AdminList
  usecase "Traiter un signalement\n(→ Mongo)" as UC_HandleReports
}

rectangle "Hors MVP complétion (GAP)" as GAP #EEEEEE {
  usecase "Modifier / annuler\ndemande" as UC_Edit
  usecase "Retirer candidature" as UC_Withdraw
  usecase "Paiement Stripe prod" as UC_PayStripe
  usecase "Multi-aidants\ncomplet" as UC_Multi
  usecase "Statut IN_PROGRESS" as UC_InProgress
  usecase "Avis / clôture\ncomplète / DISPUTED" as UC_CloseFull
  usecase "Géoloc Google" as UC_Geo
}

V --> UC_Home
V --> UC_Register
V --> UC_Login

U --> UC_Dashboard
U --> UC_Message
U --> UC_Report

D --> UC_Publish
D --> UC_ViewApplications
D --> UC_Select
D --> UC_MockPay
D --> UC_Profile

A --> UC_Browse
A --> UC_Apply
A --> UC_Profile

ADM --> UC_Login
ADM --> UC_AdminList
ADM --> UC_HandleReports

UC_Select ..> UC_MockPay : <<precede>>\nmission AWAITING_PAYMENT
UC_MockPay ..> UC_Message : <<precede>>\nsortie AWAITING_PAYMENT
UC_Report ..> UC_HandleReports : <<precede>>

note right of UC_Message
  **Option C / Mongo**
  Conversation + Message
  refs missionId / userId
  (T11) — pas en Postgres.
end note

note right of UC_Report
  **URL figée (T08/T10) :**
  POST /missions/{id}/reports
  Stockage : PostgreSQL
  Acteurs : participants mission.
end note

note right of UC_HandleReports
  Liste = signalements PG (T13).
  1 action (classer / masquer)
  → insert moderation_actions
  Mongo (T12 / T14).
end note

note bottom of GAP
  Documenté hors MVP :
  - IN_PROGRESS absent des enums code
  - multi-aidants non implémenté
    (sélection 1 aidant sur parcours livré)
  - avis, clôture complète, Stripe prod, géoloc
end note

@enduml
